  "title": "Thrift: always generate field_id proto item",
  "description": "In order to report non-matching field id, the sub-dissector requires the\nproto_item element for the field id to be created, even if the tree is not.\n\nThis also matches the expected behavior according to the comment at expert.c:561\n\n```c\n    /* XXX: can we get rid of these checks and make them programming errors instead now? */\n\tif (pi != NULL && PITEM_FINFO(pi) != NULL) {\n```",
